(22,104,'2026-08-26','SET-U editorial review','visual_facsimile','Legal','FEE-FARM, in a Legal Sense signifies Land held of another in Fee','Image [333], left column, FEE-FARM entry; e-rara content image 2867397','https://www.e-rara.ch/zut/content/zoom/2867397?query=LEGAL','Verifies a contextual use of Legal meaning related to law in 1704. It does not establish a LEGAL headword, the earliest occurrence, the Latin lex family, or any disputed deeper reconstruction.','reviewed'),
(23,105,'2026-08-26','SET-U editorial review','visual_facsimile','check','if the Tide coming about the Island from the North did not check it','Image [834], left column, tide explanation; e-rara content image 2867898','https://www.e-rara.ch/zut/content/zoom/2867898?query=CHECK','Verifies a contextual verbal use of check in the restrain-or-impede sense in 1704. It does not establish a CHECK headword, the earliest occurrence, the later verify sense, banking senses, or Persian chess ancestry.','reviewed');
